  "108311162": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1816236467,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I actually need your help with something.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "286441880": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1816236467,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Not happening. I want to buy your services.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1210122976": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1816236467,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Maybe I should. But there's something you could help me with first.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1380506238": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I need to set up a strong internet connection in my basement. It’s important.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1563807527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Dude. Your parents are loaded. What the hell do you need me for?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "338689434": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -43022966,
    532345631
   ],
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "PFFT— Hold up, hold up. You came all the way out to the badlands... to ask me... for Wi-Fi?!",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1642172801": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    2034274696,
    -1217855997,
    -1730537120
   ],
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Normally, I’d be all over a challenge like that. But... I can’t just up and leave.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setBool",
     "type": "InstructionBooleanSetBool",
     "title": "Set Events_7[tomboy-met] = True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Set": {
       "kind": "variable",
       "variable": {
        "scope": "global",
        "name": "tomboy-met",
        "list": "Events_7",
        "type": "boolean"
       }
      },
      "m_From": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": true
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-43022966": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 338689434,
   "children": [
    -1598003831
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Please Antonia. No one else can do it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "532345631": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 338689434,
   "children": [
    -1070187926
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Joey said you're the best and I can pay.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1598003831": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -43022966,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Antonia... one calls me that anymore. It’s just Toni. Stick with that, alright?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1070187926": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 532345631,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Man, that’s... really damn flattering.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1565539512": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "See... there’s a tiny problem. And by tiny, I mean big. And by problem, I mean Jack.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1490646298": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Big Jack. Runs a crew out here. Real tough bastard—big, mean, ghetto, and built like he eats steel for breakfast.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1741556587": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Let’s just say I owe him, and if I try to run, his guys will make sure I don’t run anywhere ever again, y’know?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1946678828": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1478230826,
    2015118075,
    -620976687
   ],
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Jack lives for racing. If someone beats him in a head-to-head motorbike race, and if you challenge him and win... you can demand that he lets me go.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1478230826": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1946678828,
   "children": [
    -963822945
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "If that’s what it takes, I’ll do it. Where do I find him?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2015118075": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1946678828,
   "children": [
    -816771010
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "And what happens if I lose?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-620976687": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1946678828,
   "children": [
    755905562,
    1443552166
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "So, if I win, will you also allow me to make one demand?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-963822945": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1478230826,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hell yeah! That’s the spirit!  He should be somewhere around here. Big guy, red tanktop. Hard to miss.. Once you challenge him, there’s no backing out. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-816771010": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2015118075,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, y’know... you could just end up owing Jack a favor instead. And trust me, you don’t want that. So, uh... don’t lose.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "755905562": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -620976687,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ohhh? Dangerous game you’re playing there, buddy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1443552166": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -620976687,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Win first, then maybe we’ll talk about your little ‘extra’ request.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1183923833": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good luck, man.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2034274696": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1642172801,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why not?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1217855997": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1642172801,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I'll make it worth your while. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2079485661": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Now all I need is a bike.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "919951897": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "No problem, you can use mine! Buying and registering a new one would take forever—this way, you hit the track now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1755738292": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 834224195,
   "children": [
    -1620465974
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "(Charming) Time did you good, Toni.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
